From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 13:15:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] retag: verify geometry per TENSOR for every mapped id, not a
 file-level vote on 46 only - fixes silent rewrite of mixed/ambiguous files
 and of unguarded 36/200; guard empty and overlapping tables

---
